{"ID":"20230928081959-xhb1w3f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928081959-xhb1w3f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928081959-xhb1w3f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082009-7l63mlh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082009-t4usgui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082026-yj5k39n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【十三鬼穴】","type":"doc","updated":"20230928082026"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928082009-7l63mlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-7l63mlh","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十三鬼穴，一般用于治疗癫症、痫症、狂症、鬼附身使用；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082015-ur794zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082015-ur794zw"}},{"ID":"20230928082009-rwrupps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-rwrupps","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一个癫症最好的穴道：鸠尾穴、百会；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-vt4wcdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-vt4wcdm","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"痫病：灸申脉、灸照海；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-rc9x5s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-rc9x5s1","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癫症、痫症、狂症一般来说是痰涎拥塞导致；可以用控涎丹对治；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-cluc5z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-cluc5z3","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以上为对症的正取穴，如以上正取穴无法处理，就要用到十三鬼穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082019-d0vwp1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082019-d0vwp1i"}},{"ID":"20230928082009-s0w59li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-s0w59li","updated":"20230928082023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"必须按照顺序下，针下去后男的往左转针，女的往右转，男的先下左边再下右边，女的先下右边再下左边；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928082026-yj5k39n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082026-yj5k39n"}},{"ID":"20230928082009-9vldfo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-9vldfo5","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一针人中穴，名鬼宫；第二针少商穴，名鬼信；第三针隐白穴，名鬼垒；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-x0053g2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-x0053g2","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四针太渊穴，名鬼心；第五针申脉穴，名鬼路；第六针风府穴，名鬼枕；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-455agcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-455agcq","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第七针颊车穴，名鬼床；第八针承浆穴，名鬼市；第九针劳宫穴，名鬼路（与第五针重名）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-hf41bnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-hf41bnt","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十针上星穴，名鬼堂；第十一针男为阴下缝，女为玉门头，名鬼藏；第十二针曲池穴，名鬼臣；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082009-t4usgui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082009-t4usgui","updated":"20230928082009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十三针当舌中下缝之海泉穴，名鬼封。"}]}]}